# The memory lens of lib/hf/md_eri.viv.
# A `disjoint` pin is the one fact the compiler takes on trust: every checked
# build records each element a pass writes and stops the run if two passes
# write the same one; a release build (-DVIV_RELEASE) trusts it.
mderi_build_st
  disjoint  parallel for q: Gp   "pass q writes the canonical slots of the quartet QL[q] (mderi_put skips the others), and mderi_qlist lists each quartet of pairs once"
mderi_sph_build
  disjoint  parallel for q: Gs   "pass q writes the canonical spherical slots of the quartet QL[q] (mderi_put_at skips the others), and mderi_qlist lists each quartet of pairs once"
